# Cloudflare Pages static redirects.
#
# ⚠ Pages serves clean URLs on its own: /technology.html is answered at
# /technology, and a request for /technology.html is 301'd to /technology.
# A rule here of the form "/technology /technology.html" therefore LOOPS —
# Pages sends it straight back — and the browser reports "redirected you too
# many times". Never add one. Point redirects at the clean form only.

# www → apex (backup for functions/_middleware.js).
# Only works once DNS for www exists and www is served by this project.
https://www.dcalacrity.com/* https://dcalacrity.com/:splat 301
http://www.dcalacrity.com/* https://dcalacrity.com/:splat 301

# The product page became the technology page in the Sep 2026 rebuild.
# /product was linked from the app, the press kit and social posts.
/product /technology 301
/product.html /technology 301

# "Studio" was the old label for the company page.
/studio /about 301
